flowchart TD
    G[Real Goal / Work] --> D[Task Dependency Graph]
    D --> K{What mechanism is sufficient?}
    K -->|Exact / stable| S[Deterministic Go / Rules]
    K -->|Known external operation| T[Tool / API / DB / CLI]
    K -->|Adaptive reasoning needed| A[Agent responsibility]
    A --> N{LLM needed now?}
    N -->|No| S
    N -->|Yes| IR[Inference Resource Manager]
    IR --> AE[AgentExecution]
    K -->|Interdependent collaboration justified| TM[Team]
    K -->|Human judgment / authority| H[Human Operator]
    S --> C[Completion / Evidence]
    T --> C
    AE --> C
    TM --> C
    H --> C
    C --> O[Operational Telemetry + Knowledge]
    O --> L[Lab / Controlled Replay when uncertainty exists]
